# Lead-lens sign-off for WU-4
#
# Saltzer-Schroeder principles applied and confirmed:
#   1. Economy of mechanism — workflow YAML ~99 lines; each script <=150
#   2. Fail-safe defaults — every check REFUSES on failure
#   3. Complete mediation — one workflow file; trusted publisher only
#   4. Open design — workflow is public; no secrets
#   5. Separation of privilege — single-reviewer accepted risk per ADR-004
#   6. Least privilege — id-token:write + contents:read ONLY
#   7. Least common mechanism — each scan script is single-purpose
#   8. Psychological acceptability — refusal messages name fix

